INSERT INTO product_translations (id, product_id, locale, name, slug, summary, description, usage_areas, meta_title, meta_description, translation_status) VALUES ('cda872f4-1c89-5313-8326-5660befe7490', '078921b7-e536-5eb8-9b6a-99444bf9082d', 'en', $h$GAST Air Motor 6AM-ARV-54$h$, $h$gast-air-motor-6am-arv-54$h$, $h$Mixer Motors and Equipment – Industrial Mixing Solutions$h$, $h$<div> <p>Industrial mixer motors and equipment are critical machines used to <strong>homogeneously mix, dissolve, or stabilize</strong> liquids, gels, paints, chemicals, and other fluids. They are indispensable, particularly in paint, chemical, food, and manufacturing facilities, for improving product quality and optimizing process times.</p><p>HD Marine mixer motors and accessories deliver reliable solutions for industrial mixing processes with their <strong>high performance</strong>, <strong>durability</strong>, and <strong>ease of use</strong>.</p> </div><div> <p>✔ <strong>High torque and stable performance:</strong> Powerful operation even in demanding mixing applications<br/>✔ <strong>Various mounting options:</strong> Suitable for tanks, drums, vessels, and boilers<br/>✔ <strong>Durable motor construction:</strong> Long service life under continuous operation and heavy use<br/>✔ <strong>Adjustable speed control:</strong> Mixing speed adjustment to suit your needs<br/>✔ <strong>Wide range of mixer accessories:</strong> Propeller, helical, spiral, and custom impellers</p><p>Mixing equipment is available with different <strong>motor power, speed, and shaft diameter</strong> options depending on the type of process.</p> </div>$h$, $h$<div> <p>HD Marine mixer motors and equipment deliver reliable and consistent results, particularly in:</p><ul><li>Paint production and mixing facilities</li><li>Chemical industry and process lines</li><li>Food and beverage production</li><li>Cosmetics production lines</li><li>Production of pigmented and solids-laden liquids</li><li>Laboratory mixing applications</li></ul><p>and other areas <strong>requiring high mixing performance</strong>.</p> </div>$h$, $h$GAST Air Motor 6AM-ARV-54 | HD Marine$h$, $h$Industrial mixer motors and equipment are critical machines used to homogeneously mix, dissolve, or stabilize liquids, gels, paints, chemicals, and other…$h$, 'auto') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
